do CutsceneManager.show_tower_guide_notice()
TerminalComputer: Congratulations, you have completed the Hunter's Exam. You are officially a Starspire Hunter and have been granted the class title 'Junior Hunter'.
do GameManager.end_tech_tree_tutorial()
do CutsceneManager.show_all_tech_buttons()
TerminalComputer: There are 5 more tech tree categories, boasting vastly different upgrades. Be sure to look through them. They are necessary for your climb up the Starspire.
TerminalComputer: Please report to the tower guide to start your first expedition into the Starspire.
TerminalComputer: Good luck Hunter. May your bounty be plentiful.
do GameManager.check_can_complete_tech_tree_tutorial()